{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56295","headline":"感怀 · 元淳","name":"感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙府寥寥殊未传，白云尽日对纱{车□}。\n只将（下缺。\n见伯三二一六卷。\n）（按：伯三二丈六卷存诗五首。\n前二首爲李冶《偶居》〖缺题〗和《八至篇》，其後三篇署「女道士元淳」，有总题《寄意五首》，《秦中春望》、《寄洛阳姊妹》二首完整，《全唐诗》已收。\n次即本诗，惜已残缺。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元淳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}